        "order_num": 44,
        "exam_source": "Đề 1 (SU26 FE)",
        "exam_code": "NWC204_SU26_FE",
        "content": "Under which two circumstances will a switch flood a frame out of every port except the port that the frame was received on? (Choose two answers)",
