        "exam_source": "Đề 2 (SU26 RE)",
        "exam_code": "NWC204_SU26_RE",
        "content": "A user who Is unable to connect to the file server contacts the help desk. The helpdesk technician asks the\nuser to ping the IP address of the default gateway that is configured on the workstation. What is the purpose\nfor this ping command?\n(Choose 1 answer)",
        "image_url": null,
